WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
Don't just talk empty words

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,000
Everyone is hungry

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,600
How can I share resources with you?

4
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:07,730
I think

5
00:00:07,730 --> 00:00:09,730
The first thing we do now is

6
00:00:09,730 --> 00:00:12,730
A young person from each family forms the escort team

7
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:14,530
Starting from 101 on the first floor

8
00:00:14,530 --> 00:00:16,530
Tips for finding supplies door-to-door

9
00:00:16,530 --> 00:00:18,130
Anyone who has no living people at home

10
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:19,330
Got all the supplies

11
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:22,420
Both men dared to kill people.

12
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:24,220
Then we can't sit still and wait for death.

13
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:26,220
After all, just counting on the safety of the garage

14
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:27,220
Can't stop them

15
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:29,620
So our material collection team

16
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:31,620
Must be a collective action

17
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:33,900
Even if you encounter two fierce men

18
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:35,530
Don’t be afraid

19
00:00:35,530 --> 00:00:36,930
There are only three of them

20
00:00:36,930 --> 00:00:38,760
There are more than a dozen of us

21
00:00:38,760 --> 00:00:46,380
You can still be afraid of him, right?

22
00:00:46,380 --> 00:00:47,580
Just unite

23
00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:48,580
Don't be afraid at all

24
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:50,580
How to divide the materials received?

25
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:52,380
Anyone who joins the escort team

26
00:00:52,380 --> 00:00:53,580
Materials are divided equally

27
00:00:53,580 --> 00:00:57,180
What if there are no teenagers at home?

28
00:00:57,180 --> 00:00:59,180
It’s just me and my daughter at home

29
00:00:59,180 --> 00:01:01,580
My husband has probably been a ghost doctor for a long time

30
00:01:01,580 --> 00:01:04,570
He was poisoned outside, right?

31
00:01:04,570 --> 00:01:06,770
I don’t think your distribution method works.

32
00:01:06,770 --> 00:01:08,970
My wife and I are both over sixty years old

33
00:01:08,970 --> 00:01:09,970
Inconvenient hands and feet

34
00:01:09,970 --> 00:01:10,970
Don't dare to move

35
00:01:10,970 --> 00:01:12,370
what should we do

36
00:01:12,370 --> 00:01:14,170
It's best if they are the supplies you grabbed.

37
00:01:14,170 --> 00:01:15,570
Each family should share a little bit

38
00:01:15,570 --> 00:01:21,560
Older people give priority to mothers-in-law

39
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:24,140
Still want to eat and drink for free
